 Cover: A Real Album Art Commission Walkthrough\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"18\",{\"name\":\"twitter:description\",\"content\":\"A behind-the-scenes walkthrough of an actual cover art commission, from the first brief through sketch approval to final delivery — what each stage really looks like.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"19\",{\"name\":\"twitter:image\",\"content\":\"https://jhaysanyay.com/images/cover-art/chance.jpg\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"20\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.ico?favicon.2vob68tjqpejf.ico\",\"sizes\":\"256x256\",\"type\":\"image/x-icon\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"21\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/icon.svg?icon.1hqt-6fdfs6lm.svg\",\"sizes\":\"any\",\"type\":\"image/svg+xml\"}],[\"$\",\"$L2c\",\"22\",{}]]\n","/blog/$d$slug/__PAGE__":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[53501,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3ykrlu0oa3rkw.js\"],\"default\"]\n3:I[22016,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3ykrlu0oa3rkw.js\"],\"\"]\n4:I[85437,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3ykrlu0oa3rkw.js\"],\"Image\"]\n22:X\n27:X\n27:C\n0:{\"buildId\":\"Ci70N7G2LBQG0cqRgP2oF\",\"data\":[{\"rsc\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"className\":\"min-h-screen flex flex-col bg-[var(--ink)]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-[var(--paper)] py-12 border-b-2 border-[var(--ink)] text-[var(--ink)]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"wrap max-w-4xl\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog\",\"className\":\"font-mono text-xs text-[var(--red)] uppercase font-bold tracking-wider hover:underline inline-block mb-6\",\"children\":\"← Back to All Guides\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-xs text-[var(--muted)] mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-[var(--ink)] text-[var(--paper)] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 uppercase tracking-widest text-[10px]\",\"children\":\"Case Study\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"July 22, 2025\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"7 min read\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"className\":\"font-anton text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl uppercase leading-tight text-[var(--ink)] mt-2\",\"children\":\"From Brief to Final Cover: A Real Commission Walkthrough\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-[var(--ink)]/20 font-mono text-xs\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[var(--muted)] uppercase\",\"children\":\"Written by:\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--ink)]\",\"children\":\"Jhay Sanyay\"}]]}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"article\",null,{\"className\":\"py-16 bg-[var(--ink)] text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"wrap max-w-3xl space-y-8 font-sans text-lg leading-relaxed text-[var(--paper-2)]/90\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative aspect-[16/9] w-full border-2 border-[var(--paper-2)]/30 overflow-hidden mb-10 shadow-2xl\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{\"src\":\"/images/cover-art/chance.jpg\",\"alt\":\"From Brief to Final Cover: A Real Commission Walkthrough\",\"fill\":true,\"sizes\":\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 800px\",\"className\":\"object-cover\",\"priority\":true}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Guides on how commissions work tend to describe the process in the abstract — brief, sketch, revisions, delivery. It's accurate, but it doesn't show what each stage actually involves in practice. Here's a real walkthrough, stage by stage.\"]}],[\"$\",\"hr\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Stage 1: The Initial Brief\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"6\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"The project starts with a client sending a reference set: two existing covers whose color mood they liked, a rough description of the scene they had in mind, and the exact title text needed. They also flagged the intended use — a streaming release, so square format at full resolution was the target.\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"8\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"What this stage actually determines:\"}],\" scope, and therefore the quote. A brief this specific usually moves straight to a quote without a back-and-forth clarifying round, because there's nothing ambiguous left to ask about.\"]}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"10\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Stage 2: Quote and Timeline\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"12\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Based on the brief — one main subject, a moderately detailed background, standard commercial release rights — a price and a two-week turnaround were confirmed. This is also the point where revision rounds get set explicitly, so there's no ambiguity later about how many passes are included.\"]}],\"$L5\",\"$L6\",\"$L7\",\"$L8\",\"$L9\",\"$La\",\"$Lb\",\"$Lc\",\"$Ld\",\"$Le\",\"$Lf\",\"$L10\",\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\",\"$L14\",\"$L15\",\"$L16\",\"$L17\",\"$L18\",\"$L19\",\"$L1a\",\"$L1b\"]}],\"$L1c\"]}]}],\"$L1d\",\"$L1e\"]}],[\"$L1f\"],\"$L20\"]}],\"isPartial\":\"$@21\",\"staleTime\":\"$22\",\"varyParams\":null},{\"rsc\":\"$L23\",\"isPartial\":\"$@24\",\"staleTime\":\"$22\",\"varyParams\":null},{\"rsc\":\"$L25\",\"isPartial\":\"$@26\",\"staleTime\":\"$22\",\"varyParams\":\"$27\"},{\"rsc\":\"$L28\",\"isPartial\":\"$@29\",\"staleTime\":\"$22\",\"varyParams\":\"$27\"},{\"rsc\":\"$L2a\",\"isPartial\":\"$@2b\",\"staleTime\":\"$22\",\"varyParams\":null}],\"isUpgradeableISRFallback\":false,\"a\":\"$@2c\",\"rootVaryParams\":null,\"needsRuntimeRequest\":\"$@2d\"}\n2e:I[87879,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3ykrlu0oa3rkw.js\"],\"default\"]\n2f:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n30:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\n32:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\n33:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"MetadataBoundary\"]\n34:I[27201,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"IconMark\"]\n35:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"default\"]\n36:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"default\"]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/2b2j6nos8u62l.css\",\"style\"]\n5:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"14\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Stage 3: The Sketch Stage\"}]\n6:[\"$\",\"p\",\"16\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Before any color or detail work begins, a rough composition sketch goes to the client for approval. This is the cheapest point to catch a mismatch — if the pose, framing, or layout isn't right, it's a quick fix here instead of a costly rework after full rendering.\"]}]\n7:[\"$\",\"p\",\"18\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"In this project, the first sketch was close but the client wanted the composition shifted to leave more space for the title text at the top — a five-minute adjustment at this stage that would have been a much bigger one after full color work.\"]}]\n8:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"20\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Stage 4: Line Art and Base Color\"}]\n9:[\"$\",\"p\",\"22\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Once the sketch is approved, the piece moves to full line work and base color blocking. This is usually the longest single stage, since it's where the actual detail — texture, character rendering, background elements — gets built out.\"]}]\na:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"24\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Stage 5: Rendering and Lighting\"}]\nb:[\"$\",\"p\",\"26\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Full shading, lighting, and detail pass. This is where a flat, sketch-accurate piece turns into a finished illustration — depth, highlights, and atmosphere get added here.\"]}]\nc:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"28\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Stage 6: Revisions\"}]\nd:[\"$\",\"p\",\"30\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"With the piece fully rendered, the client requested one adjustment: a slightly warmer color grade to better match their previous release's visual identity. This kind of targeted, specific revision request — tied to a clear reason — is typically the fastest kind to execute, compared to open-ended feedback like \\\"make it pop more.\\\"\"]}]\ne:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"32\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Stage 7: Final Delivery\"}]\nf:[\"$\",\"p\",\"34\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Final files delivered in two formats: a high-resolution print-ready file and a platform-optimized square file for streaming thumbnails. Commercial usage rights were confirmed as part of delivery, matching what was agreed at the quote stage.\"]}]\n10:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"36\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n11:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"38\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"What Made This Project Go Smoothly\"}]\n12:[\"$\",\"p\",\"40\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Looking back at the whole process, a few things stand out as the actual reasons it moved efficiently:\"]}]\n13:[\"$\",\"li\",\"42\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"The initial brief was specific\"}],\", which skipped an entire round of clarifying questions\"]}]\n14:[\"$\",\"li\",\"43\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Sketch approval caught the one real issue early\"}],\", before it was expensive to fix\"]}]\n15:[\"$\",\"li\",\"44\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"The one revision request was specific and comparative\"}],\" (\\\"warmer, like this other cover\\\") rather than vague\"]}]\n16:[\"$\",\"li\",\"45\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Rights and format were agreed before work started\"}],\", not negotiated at delivery\"]}]\n17:[\"$\",\"p\",\"47\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"None of this required unusual effort from the client — just preparation before the first message, and specific feedback at each checkpoint.\"]}]\n18:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"49\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n19:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"51\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Final Thoughts\"}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"p\",\"53\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"The gap between a commission that takes two weeks smoothly and one that drags on for two months usually isn't about the artist's speed — it's about how much clarity exists at each checkpoint. A specific brief, a real sketch-approval step, and targeted feedback are what make the difference.\"]}]\n1b:[\"$\",\"p\",\"55\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"If you're planning a commission and want a process structured this way, \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"/#order\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--yellow)] font-bold underline hover:text-[var(--red)] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"album, manga, and illustration commissions here\"}],\" follow this same brief-to-delivery flow.\"]}]\n1c:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-16 p-8 bg-[var(--paper)] text-[var(--ink)] border-2 border-[var(--ink)] shadow-[10px_10px_0_var(--red)]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mono text-xs text-[var(--red)] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\",\"children\":\"Ready to Commission?\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase mb-3\",\"children\":\"Get Your Custom Artwork Stamped\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-sans text-[var(--muted)] mb-6\",\"children\":\"Jhay Sanyay Studio handles custom cover art, manga/comic illustrations, and logo design from brief submission to final delivery. Fill out your job ticket below for a 48-hour quote.\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#order\",\"className\":\"stamp-btn inline-block !py-3 !px-6\",\"children\":\"FILL OUT JOB TICKET\"}]]}]\n1d:[\"$\",\"$L2e\",null,{}]\n1e:[\"$\",\"footer\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-[var(--ink)] border-t-2 border-[var(--paper-2)] py-10 color-[var(--paper-2)]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"wrap flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-[10px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"foot-brand font-anton text-[28px] tracking-[0.04em] text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"JHAY SANYAY\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"foot-sub font-mono text-[12px] text-[var(--muted)] uppercase\",\"children\":\"Visual Artist & Illustrator · Nigeria\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"foot-links flex gap-[20px] font-mono text-[12px] mt-[10px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/portfolio\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--yellow)] hover:underline\",\"children\":\"Portfolio\"}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--yellow)] hover:underline\",\"children\":\"Guides & Blog\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://linktr.ee/jhaysanyay\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--yellow)] hover:underline\",\"children\":\"Linktree ↗\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"/#order\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--yellow)] hover:underline\",\"children\":\"Job Ticket\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[12px] text-[var(--yellow)] mt-[20px] tracking-wider uppercase\",\"children\":[\"designed by \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.instagram.com/buildwithclinton/\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--paper)] hover:text-[var(--yellow)] hover:underline transition-colors\",\"children\":\"buildwithclinton ↗\"}]]}]]}]}]\n1f:[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-0\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/chunks/3ykrlu0oa3rkw.js\",\"async\":true}]\n20:[\"$\",\"$L2f\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$30\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@31\"}]}]\n23:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L32\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div